Upstream-Name: raye-proton
Source: https://github.com/Raye-Linux/iso
Comment: Raye Proton is GE-Proton (https://github.com/GloriousEggroll/proton-ge-custom),
 tag and commit in ge-version.txt, built unchanged by build-ge.sh with
 GE-Proton's own build system; only the name Steam shows is set
 (raye/raye-proton-name). GE-Proton is Valve's Proton
 (https://github.com/ValveSoftware/Proton) with Wine, wine-staging, DXVK,
 VKD3D-Proton, dxvk-nvapi, FFmpeg, protonfixes, umu and the other
 components listed in .gitmodules of that tag. The licence and notice
 files of GE-Proton and of every component are installed in
 /usr/share/doc/raye-proton/licenses, under each component's path. The
 source of every component is the tag above with its git submodules.
 Raye Proton is not affiliated with Valve or with the GE-Proton project.

